  "statement": "Let \\(N=2^{\\left(2^{2}\\right)}\\) and \\(x\\) be a real number such that \\(N^{\\left(N^{N}\\right)}=2^{\\left(2^{x}\\right)}\\). Find \\(x\\).",
  "answerChoices": [],
