      "id": "sol.hmmt-feb-algebra-number-theory-2019-p2.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Answer: 66\nWe compute\n\n\\[N^{\\left(N^{N}\\right)}=16^{16^{16}}=2^{4 \\cdot 2^{4 \\cdot 2^{4}}}=2^{2^{2^{6}+2}}=2^{2^{66}}\\]\n\nso \\(x=66\\).",
